  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HMA Sri Lanka</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support safe resettlement and recovery in northern and eastern Sri Lanka through survey, clearance, and risk education. It will help restore access to land, housing, infrastructure, schools, livelihoods, and natural resources in communities still affected by contamination from past conflict, while also strengthening a national demining partner and supporting links between mine action, development, and environmental conservation.</narrative>
  </description>
